{"4358930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vampirio", "steam_appid": 4358930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampirio is a survival roguelike with a <strong>day/night loop</strong>: as a vampiro hero, build your fortress in daylight, then fight off <strong>monsters, undead, and dragons</strong> at night in fast, skill-based combat. Every run brings new upgrade choices and every night tests your defences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE NIGHT (ROGUELIKE COMBAT) 🌙</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness falls, the raid begins:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave survival against monsters, undead, and dragons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomised upgrades and skill picks that change each run<br><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/7c6f27b2d74c1f945ff37da7953b11fd.poster.avif?t=1780669898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/7c6f27b2d74c1f945ff37da7953b11fd.webm?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/7c6f27b2d74c1f945ff37da7953b11fd.mp4?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR FORTRESS (DAYTIME) ☀️</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the day to prepare for the next assault:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade walls, towers, and key defences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources and expand your layout over time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/ee35ce125973762bfa5aebca26cda8f9.poster.avif?t=1780669898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/ee35ce125973762bfa5aebca26cda8f9.webm?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/ee35ce125973762bfa5aebca26cda8f9.mp4?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEROES, GEAR, AND POWER SPIKES ⚔️ </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create builds that match your style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade heroes, improve gear, and unlock skills as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimates that can turn the tide when you’re overwhelmed</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/0d464b83ed9c3c35d846eab4c9e09ca6.poster.avif?t=1780669898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/0d464b83ed9c3c35d846eab4c9e09ca6.webm?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/0d464b83ed9c3c35d846eab4c9e09ca6.mp4?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAMPAIGN PROGRESSION 👑</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push across a world map with escalating challenges that test both your fortress upgrades and your combat build. Follow the Dracul family’s revenge story across a mission-filled map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/1a63fdae0987db65493e8ab85299b0f9.poster.avif?t=1780669898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/1a63fdae0987db65493e8ab85299b0f9.webm?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/1a63fdae0987db65493e8ab85299b0f9.mp4?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampirio is a survival roguelike with a <strong>day/night loop</strong>: as a vampiro hero, build your fortress in daylight, then fight off <strong>monsters, undead, and dragons</strong> at night in fast, skill-based combat. Every run brings new upgrade choices and every night tests your defences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE NIGHT (ROGUELIKE COMBAT) 🌙</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness falls, the raid begins:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave survival against monsters, undead, and dragons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomised upgrades and skill picks that change each run<br><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/7c6f27b2d74c1f945ff37da7953b11fd.poster.avif?t=1780669898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/7c6f27b2d74c1f945ff37da7953b11fd.webm?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/7c6f27b2d74c1f945ff37da7953b11fd.mp4?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR FORTRESS (DAYTIME) ☀️</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the day to prepare for the next assault:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade walls, towers, and key defences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources and expand your layout over time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/ee35ce125973762bfa5aebca26cda8f9.poster.avif?t=1780669898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/ee35ce125973762bfa5aebca26cda8f9.webm?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/ee35ce125973762bfa5aebca26cda8f9.mp4?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEROES, GEAR, AND POWER SPIKES ⚔️ </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create builds that match your style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade heroes, improve gear, and unlock skills as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimates that can turn the tide when you’re overwhelmed</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/0d464b83ed9c3c35d846eab4c9e09ca6.poster.avif?t=1780669898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930/extras/0d464b83ed9c3c35d846eab4c9e09ca6.webm?t=1780669898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358930